 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In Bramblewick, your daydreams float over your head.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "If two hundred people picture one thing, it comes true.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Tess's bubble was always full of monsters.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "But never Mister Stilts and his hundred blinking eyes.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "The clock tower counts who's picturing him.",
   "tag": "[serious]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "In class, Tess got bored, and there he was.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Click. One.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "“Do not picture Mister Stilts!”",
   "tag": "[shouting]",
   "pause": 0.16,
   "voice": "mayor",
   "speak": "Do not picture Mister Stilts!"
  },
  {
   "text": "By lunch, forty. Everyone blamed Tess. Mom made her wear a laundry basket.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "The mayor got louder: billboards, pizza boxes, a blimp.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "One fifty. One ninety-nine.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the pizza guy read his own box. Up popped the eyes.",
   "tag": "[tense]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody can read “don't picture him” without picturing him.",
   "tag": "[realizing]",
   "pause": 0.12,
   "speak": "Nobody can read don't picture him without picturing him."
  },
  {
   "text": "So Tess climbed her roof with a megaphone.",
   "tag": "[determined]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "“Whatever you do, don't picture Mister Stilts in a sparkly tutu!”",
   "tag": "[shouting]",
   "pause": 0.16,
   "voice": "tess",
   "speak": "Whatever you do, don't picture Mister Stilts in a sparkly tutu!"
  },
  {
   "text": "Two hundred. In the square stood Mister Stilts, in a sparkly tutu.",
   "tag": "[mysterious]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "He tap-danced past the mayor, who fainted.",
   "tag": "[amused]",
   "pause": 0.12
  },
  {
   "text": "Now he does birthday parties, booked until 2032.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.12,
   "speak": "Now he does birthday parties, booked until twenty thirty-two."
  },
  {
   "text": "Every night, a long green finger taps Tess's window. He needs new moves.",
   "tag": "[warm]",
   "pause": 0.12
  }
 ],
